  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SheTrades: Accelerator Programme for women entrepreneurs in the Apparel, Accessories and Home D&#xe9;cor sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is targeting women-led businesses (WLBs) in the Apparel, Accessories and Home D&#xe9;cor sector from Iraq, Jordan, Kenya, Lebanon, Senegal, and South Africa. It aims to support income generation and job creation for women-led businesses and their communities by: Creating a more supportive ecosystem of partners and institutions to help the growth of women&#x2019;s economic empowerment initiatives and activities; Increasing the competitiveness of women-led businesses in the sector; Creating new market linkage and trade opportunities for women owned businesses in the sector.</narrative>
  </description>
